cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, cite it via this metadata."
title: "hadamard-formal: Lean verification of periodic T-matrix constructions"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of a parity obstruction for symmetric
  zero-row-sum sign matrices, the Goethals-Seidel and Cooper-Wallis
  constructions, kernel-checked periodic T-matrix and Williamson witnesses,
  and Hadamard existence results at eight orders from 2884 through 11948.
version: 0.1.0
url: "https://github.com/JD-Jones-ASES/Hadamard-formal"
date-released: 2026-08-30
authors:
